      "notes": "Runs eight exact same-fixture cases. Badge, Button, Tabs, Dialog and DropdownMenu cite pinned shadcn-ui/ui@4baadbc6517070ae8f8feb2c97037adc2b305544 sources under apps/v4/registry/bases/radix/ui/{badge,button,tabs,dialog,dropdown-menu}.tsx; dialog.tsx and dropdown-menu.tsx are import-path-only vendors of those files; badge.tsx, button.tsx, and tabs.tsx are port-selected class-hook adaptations of the same cited sources (plus local icon-placeholder resolution). The three Calendar cases cite apps/v4/registry/bases/radix/ui/calendar.tsx at the current component pin shadcn-ui/ui@7c9eaba1c0a6404c990c144a654792e3313c650d, with the same Nova class-hook resolution the shipped component applies and real react-day-picker@10.0.1 on the React side; they compare mount markup for the plain, dropdown plus week-number, and range configurations and across month navigation. Day selection is excluded: after a day click the two sides diverge on day-picker’s focused day, because upstream’s inline components rebuild the day-button type and its removal clears that state, and because octane emits no blur when a focused node is replaced. Local React references are lineage evidence with documented transforms, not the pinned oracle itself.",
